(()=>{const figure=document.querySelector('.equipment-photo-sequence');if(!figure)return;const photos=[...figure.querySelectorAll('img')],caption=figure.querySelector('figcaption');let index=0;setInterval(()=>{if(document.hidden||matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)return;index=(index+1)%photos.length;photos.forEach((photo,i)=>photo.classList.toggle('is-visible',i===index));caption.textContent=photos[index].alt},4200)})();
